Z||000017||fierohoho||07-28-2001||05:07 PM||||I live in a rural area and we have two horses.<P>To keep the horses off the fence we installed an electric fence, easy install, one ground rod 8' long and the wire around the perimeter. <P>Now I can park my fiero next to the fence, turn the fence off, and run a small wire from the fence (hot) to the car, a metal point of course.<P>The tires insulate the car from the ground.<P>Turn the fence on and go to bed.<P>I have taken a shock from this fence and I let out a yell, I'm waiting for the badguy to try, bet I hear em.<P>Hope I catch em.(evil laughter)<P>You could get your own fencer just for the car if you wanted.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
